Short:    UnZip v5.32 .ZIP archive extracter
Author:   kie@pacbell.net, John.Bush@East.Sun.COM, and e9225662@student.tuwien.ac.at
Uploader: rraWedor@metrodowntown.com
Version:  v5.32, fUnZip v3.93
Type:     util/arc
Replaces: util/arc/UnZip.lha

UnZip v5.32, fUnZip (filter UnZip) v3.93, and MakeSfx (no version number).
Extracts .ZIP archives, compatible with .ZIPs created with up to version 2.04g
of PKZip.

